00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:21.449
Mark Blackman: We need to continue to increase the scalability of mainnet and other high-row networks.

139
00:20:21.620 --> 00:20:27.739
Mark Blackman: And then, add new features and, new value for developers.

140
00:20:27.900 --> 00:20:38.170
